00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:19.560
I can't remember what.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.830
He's like, it's fine.

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.990
So you got that guy.

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:23.990
Okay.

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:27.350
So B-listers, I think those are the guys that
are going to...

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:30.400
So you've got War Machine, guys like that.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:34.070
